    Key <color=#ffffff><b>R</b></color>
    : Reset Selected Mirror Rotation

    Key <color=#ffffff><b>Delete</b></color>
    : Delete Selected Mirror

    Key <color=#ffffff><b>C</b></color> : Delete All
    Mirrors

    Key <color=#ffffff><b>Tab</b></color> : Change Rotation Mode


    Mouse
    <color=#ffffff><b>Left</b></color> Click : Select Mirror

    Mouse <color=#ffffff><b>Left</b></color>
    Drag : Set Mirror Position

    Mouse <color=#ffffff><b>Right</b></color> Drag
    : Set Mirror Rotation (<color=#00CED1><b>X</b></color> / <color=#EEDD82><b>Y</b></color>)

    Mouse
    <color=#ffffff><b>Wheel</b></color> Drag : Set Mirror Rotation (Z)'
